---
import DemoLayout from '../../../layouts/DemoLayout.astro'
const homes = [
 {name:'The Courtyard House',area:'Ubud, Bali',city:'Bali',type:'Villa',price:'Rp 4,8 M',beds:3,size:280,img:'photo-1600607687920-4e2a09cf159d',tag:'Pilihan kurator'},
 {name:'A Quiet Perspective',area:'Dago, Bandung',city:'Bandung',type:'Rumah',price:'Rp 3,2 M',beds:4,size:240,img:'photo-1600566753086-00f18fb6b3ea',tag:'Baru hadir'},
 {name:'Above the Ordinary',area:'Setiabudi, Jakarta',city:'Jakarta',type:'Apartemen',price:'Rp 2,4 M',beds:2,size:126,img:'photo-1600210492486-724fe5c67fb0',tag:'Siap huni'},
 {name:'Palm Residence',area:'Pererenan, Bali',city:'Bali',type:'Villa',price:'Rp 6,1 M',beds:4,size:360,img:'photo-1600607687939-ce8a6c25118c',tag:'Ruang untuk pulang'},
 {name:'The Garden Address',area:'Ciumbuleuit, Bandung',city:'Bandung',type:'Rumah',price:'Rp 2,9 M',beds:3,size:210,img:'photo-1600047509807-ba8f99d2cdde',tag:'Dekat alam'},
 {name:'Sunday at Home',area:'Kemang, Jakarta',city:'Jakarta',type:'Rumah',price:'Rp 5,2 M',beds:4,size:310,img:'photo-1600607688969-a5bfcd646154',tag:'Pilihan kurator'},
]
---
<DemoLayout title="RUANG — Homes with a point of view" slug="properti" description="Demo properti pilihan dengan pencarian lokasi, filter tipe hunian, dan jadwal kunjungan.">
 <div class="ruang">
  <header class="nav wrap"><a class="brand" href="#demo-main">ruang<span>®</span></a><nav aria-label="Navigasi Ruang"><a href="#koleksi">Koleksi hunian</a><a href="#filosofi">Cara kami memilih</a></nav><a class="contact" href="#koleksi">Temukan ruang Anda ↗</a></header>
  <div>
   <section class="hero wrap"><div class="hero-top"><p class="eyebrow">CURATED HOMES. CONSIDERED LIVING.</p><p class="edition">INDONESIA / VOL. 026</p></div><h1>Tempat yang tepat.<br/>Hidup yang <em>lebih berarti.</em></h1><div class="hero-picture"><img src="/images/demo-assets/photo-1600607687920-4e2a09cf159d.webp" alt="Hunian modern dengan interior terbuka dan cahaya alami" fetchpriority="high"/><div class="hero-caption"><span>01 / FEATURED RESIDENCE</span><strong>The Courtyard House</strong><p>Ubud, Bali · Architecture that lets life in.</p></div><a href="#koleksi" class="round" aria-label="Jelajahi koleksi hunian">↘</a></div><div class="hero-bottom"><p>Kami percaya rumah yang baik mengubah cara Anda hidup.<br/>Temukan hunian dengan karakter, dipilih dengan penuh pertimbangan.</p><span>SCROLL TO DISCOVER ↓</span></div></section>
   <section id="koleksi" class="collection wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE COLLECTION</p><h2>Ruang untuk cerita baru.</h2></div><span id="home-count" aria-live="polite">6 hunian pilihan</span></div><form id="home-filter" class="filters"><label>LOKASI<select name="city" aria-label="Lokasi hunian"><option value="">Semua kota</option><option>Bali</option><option>Bandung</option><option>Jakarta</option></select></label><label>TIPE HUNIAN<select name="type" aria-label="Tipe hunian"><option value="">Semua tipe</option><option>Villa</option><option>Rumah</option><option>Apartemen</option></select></label><button type="submit">Cari hunian <span>↗</span></button><button class="reset" type="reset">Reset</button></form><div class="properties">{homes.map((home,index)=><article class="property" data-city={home.city} data-type={home.type}><button class="image-button" data-home={index} aria-label={`Lihat detail ${home.name}`}><img src={`/images/demo-assets/${home.img}.webp`} alt={`Interior ${home.name}`} loading="lazy"/><span>{home.tag}</span><i aria-hidden="true">↗</i></button><div class="property-meta"><p>{home.area}</p><p>{home.type}</p></div><h3><button data-home={index}>{home.name}</button></h3><div class="property-bottom"><span>{home.beds} kamar · {home.size} m²</span><strong>{home.price}</strong></div></article>)}</div><p id="empty-homes" hidden>Tidak ada hunian untuk kombinasi ini. Coba lokasi atau tipe lainnya.</p></section>
   <section id="filosofi" class="philosophy"><div class="wrap philosophy-grid"><p class="eyebrow">OUR POINT OF VIEW</p><div><h2>Bukan sekadar alamat.<br/>Sebuah <em>rasa memiliki.</em></h2><p>Dari cahaya yang jatuh di ruang keluarga hingga taman kecil tempat Anda memulai pagi. Kami mencari detail yang membuat sebuah bangunan terasa seperti rumah.</p><div class="principles"><div><b>01</b><h3>Desain yang bermakna</h3><p>Arsitektur dengan karakter dan fungsi yang selaras.</p></div><div><b>02</b><h3>Lokasi yang hidup</h3><p>Lingkungan yang mendukung ritme keseharian Anda.</p></div><div><b>03</b><h3>Dipilih, bukan dikumpulkan</h3><p>Koleksi terbatas dengan perhatian di setiap detail.</p></div></div></div></div></section>
  </div><footer class="wrap footer"><a class="brand" href="#demo-main">ruang<span>®</span></a><p>A considered place to call home.</p><span>© 2026 RUANG · Konsep & data demo</span></footer>
  <dialog id="home-dialog" aria-labelledby="home-title"><button class="dialog-close" aria-label="Tutup detail">×</button><img id="home-photo" src="/images/demo-assets/photo-1600607687920-4e2a09cf159d.webp" alt="Pratinjau properti"/><div class="dialog-body"><p id="home-area" class="eyebrow"></p><h2 id="home-title"></h2><p id="home-spec"></p><strong id="home-price"></strong><p>Ruang terbuka, material alami, dan cahaya yang berlimpah. Detail properti dan harga ini merupakan contoh untuk demonstrasi.</p><form id="visit-form"><label>Rencana kunjungan<input id="visit-date" type="date" required/></label><button type="submit">Simulasikan jadwal kunjungan ↗</button></form><p id="visit-status" role="status"></p></div></dialog>
 </div>
 <script define:vars={{homes}}>
 const form=document.querySelector('#home-filter');
 function filterHomes(){const values=new FormData(form);let count=0;document.querySelectorAll('.property').forEach(card=>{const match=(!values.get('city')||card.dataset.city===values.get('city'))&&(!values.get('type')||card.dataset.type===values.get('type'));card.hidden=!match;if(match)count++;});document.querySelector('#home-count').textContent=count+' hunian pilihan';document.querySelector('#empty-homes').hidden=count!==0;}
 form.addEventListener('submit',e=>{e.preventDefault();filterHomes()});form.addEventListener('reset',()=>setTimeout(filterHomes,0));
 const dialog=document.querySelector('#home-dialog');const date=document.querySelector('#visit-date');const today=new Date();date.min=new Date(today.getTime()-today.getTimezoneOffset()*60000).toISOString().slice(0,10);
 document.querySelectorAll('[data-home]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{const home=homes[Number(button.dataset.home)];document.querySelector('#home-title').textContent=home.name;document.querySelector('#home-area').textContent=home.area+' / '+home.type;document.querySelector('#home-spec').textContent=home.beds+' kamar tidur · '+home.size+' m² · Sertifikat contoh SHM';document.querySelector('#home-price').textContent=home.price;const photo=document.querySelector('#home-photo');photo.src='/images/demo-assets/'+home.img+'.webp';photo.alt=home.name;document.querySelector('#visit-status').textContent='';document.querySelector('#visit-form').reset();dialog.showModal();}));
 dialog.querySelector('.dialog-close').addEventListener('click',()=>dialog.close());dialog.addEventListener('click',e=>{if(e.target===dialog)dialog.close()});document.querySelector('#visit-form').addEventListener('submit',e=>{e.preventDefault();document.querySelector('#visit-status').textContent='Jadwal demo dipilih: '+new Date(date.value+'T12:00:00').toLocaleDateString('id-ID',{dateStyle:'long'})+'. Tidak ada kunjungan nyata yang dibuat.';});
 </script>
 <style>
 .ruang{background:#f7f7f2;color:#28372d;font-family:Arial,sans-serif}.wrap{max-width:1360px;margin:auto;padding-left:5%;padding-right:5%}.nav{height:104px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid #d9ddd5}.brand{font-size:44px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-3px;text-decoration:none}.brand span{font-size:14px;vertical-align:top;letter-spacing:0;margin-left:5px}.nav nav{display:flex;gap:32px;font-size:13px}.nav a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.contact{font-size:12px;border-bottom:1px solid;padding:12px 0}.hero{padding-top:40px}.hero-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between}.eyebrow,.edition{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;font-weight:600}.edition{color:#686d66}h1{font:clamp(44px,5.8vw,82px)/1.1 Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-3px;margin:30px 0 42px;font-weight:400}em{font-weight:400;color:#777f66}.hero-picture{height:480px;position:relative;background:#c7d0bb;overflow:hidden}.hero-picture>img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}.hero-picture:after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:40% 0 0;background:linear-gradient(transparent,#17251dc9);pointer-events:none}.hero-caption{position:absolute;bottom:36px;left:36px;color:white;z-index:1}.hero-caption span{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:2px}.hero-caption strong{display:block;font:32px Georgia,serif;margin-top:12px}.hero-caption p{font-size:12px;margin-top:8px}.round{position:absolute;right:36px;bottom:36px;z-index:1;width:60px;height:60px;border-radius:100%;background:#f3f3db;color:#28372d;text-align:center;line-height:60px;font-size:25px;text-decoration:none}.hero-bottom{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:25px 0 48px}.hero-bottom p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;color:#6a6f65}.hero-bottom>span{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:2px}.collection{padding-top:55px;padding-bottom:90px}.section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end}.section-head h2{font:38px Georgia,serif;margin:16px 0 0}.section-head>span{font-size:12px;color:#697066}.filters{display:flex;align-items:stretch;border-top:1px solid #cfd4c9;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd4c9;margin:30px 0 34px;padding:15px 0;gap:20px}.filters label{flex:1;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:1.5px;border-right:1px solid #cfd4c9}.filters select{display:block;background:transparent;border:0;color:#28372d;width:95%;font:14px Arial;margin-top:10px;padding:0 12px 0 0}.filters button,.dialog-body button{border:0;background:#283e31;color:white;padding:16px 26px;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer}.filters button span{margin-left:35px}.filters .reset{background:transparent;color:#283e31;padding:10px}.properties{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:38px 25px}.property[hidden]{display:none}.image-button{display:block;width:100%;height:270px;border:0;padding:0;position:relative;overflow:hidden;cursor:pointer;background:#d6dccd}.image-button img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;transition:transform .4s}.image-button:hover img{transform:scale(1.035)}.image-button>span{position:absolute;top:16px;left:16px;background:#f7f7f2;padding:8px 12px;font-size:9px}.image-button i{position:absolute;right:16px;bottom:16px;background:#f7f7f2;width:32px;height:32px;line-height:32px;border-radius:50%;font-style:normal}.property-meta,.property-bottom{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:10px;color:#697165}.property-meta{margin-top:18px}.property h3{font:24px Georgia,serif;margin:10px 0 18px}.property h3 button{font:inherit;color:inherit;background:none;border:0;padding:0;text-align:left;cursor:pointer}.property-bottom{border-top:1px solid #d9ddd3;padding-top:14px}.property-bottom strong{font-size:14px;font-weight:500;color:#28372d}.philosophy{background:#e9ecdf;padding:75px 0}.philosophy-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 3fr;gap:50px}.philosophy h2{font:46px/1.2 Georgia,serif;margin:0 0 25px}.philosophy h2+p{max-width:590px;line-height:1.8;font-size:13px;color:#61685b}.principles{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:25px;margin-top:40px;border-top:1px solid #c8cebd;padding-top:25px}.principles b{font:20px Georgia,serif;color:#606654}.principles h3{font-size:13px;margin:20px 0 10px}.principles p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;color:#61685b}.footer{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:40px;padding-top:40px;padding-bottom:40px}.footer p{font:italic 18px Georgia,serif}.footer>span{margin-left:auto;font-size:10px;color:#61685b}dialog{border:0;padding:0;max-width:580px;width:calc(100% - 32px);max-height:90dvh;color:#28372d;background:#f7f7f2}dialog::backdrop{background:#132219aa}dialog>img{width:100%;height:230px;object-fit:cover}.dialog-close{position:absolute;right:12px;top:12px;background:#fff;border:0;width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;font-size:23px;cursor:pointer}.dialog-body{padding:28px}.dialog-body h2{font:30px Georgia;margin:16px 0}.dialog-body>p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.7}.dialog-body>strong{display:block;font-size:23px;margin:20px 0}.dialog-body form{display:grid;gap:15px;margin-top:20px}.dialog-body label{font-size:12px}.dialog-body input{display:block;width:100%;border:1px solid #bbc4b5;background:white;padding:12px;margin-top:8px}.dialog-body #visit-status{color:#42633a}a:focus-visible,button:focus-visible,select:focus-visible,input:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #a0aa73;outline-offset:4px}@media(max-width:800px){.nav{height:80px}.nav nav{display:none}.brand{font-size:36px}.hero-top .edition{display:none}h1{letter-spacing:-2px}.hero-picture{height:400px}.hero-bottom>span{display:none}.properties{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.philosophy-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:25px}.footer{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:20px}.footer>span{width:100%;margin:0}.image-button{height:240px}}@media(max-width:520px){.contact{font-size:10px}.hero{padding-top:25px}h1{font-size:42px;letter-spacing:-1.7px;margin-top:25px}.hero-picture{height:360px}.hero-caption{left:22px;bottom:25px}.hero-caption strong{font-size:25px}.hero-caption p{font-size:10px}.round{right:20px;bottom:25px;width:42px;height:42px;line-height:42px}.hero-bottom{padding-bottom:0}.hero-bottom p{font-size:11px}.section-head{display:block}.section-head h2{font-size:31px;margin-bottom:16px}.filters{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:15px}.filters label{min-width:40%}.filters button[type=submit]{flex:1}.properties{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:32px}.image-button{height:290px}.philosophy{padding:45px 0}.philosophy h2{font-size:36px}.principles{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px}.principles h3{margin-top:8px}.collection{padding-bottom:55px}}
 </style>
</DemoLayout>
